    "开启后，记录心情时可以立即补充一段语音。仅在 App 内可用，锁屏和桌面小组件不支持录音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, you can add a voice note right after logging a mood. Only available in the app — Lock Screen and Home Screen widgets don't support recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
